title Kaasu: Order state machine
direction down
colorMode bold
styleMode shadow
typeface clean

Created [shape: oval, icon: plus-circle, color: "#5B6168"]
Queued [icon: list, color: "#5B6168", label: "Queued (amount pool full)"]
Awaiting [icon: clock, color: "#E8A33D", label: "Awaiting payment"]
Matched [shape: diamond, icon: check-square, color: "#3FC59A", label: "Alert matched"]
Confirmed [shape: oval, icon: check-circle, color: "#0F7B5F"]
Review [icon: alert-circle, color: "#9A5410", label: "Needs your OK"]
Rejected [shape: oval, icon: x-circle, color: "#B42318"]
Cancelled [shape: oval, icon: slash, color: "#5B6168"]
Expired [icon: clock, color: "#5B6168", label: "Expired"]
Late paid [icon: alert-triangle, color: "#9A5410", label: "Late paid"]
Refunded [shape: oval, icon: rotate-ccw, color: "#9A5410", label: "Refunded"]
Disputed [shape: oval, icon: alert-octagon, color: "#B42318", label: "Disputed"]

Created > Awaiting: amount reserved
Created > Queued: no free amount
Queued > Awaiting: amount frees up
Awaiting > Matched: signed alert
Awaiting > Cancelled: shop / customer
Awaiting > Expired: timeout
Matched > Confirmed: exact amount, high score
Matched > Review: mismatch or over limit
Review > Confirmed: merchant OK
Review > Rejected: not received
Expired > Late paid: alert after expiry
Late paid > Review
Confirmed > Refunded: merchant refunds
Confirmed > Disputed: not in statement
